# The access list (docs/security.md, section 4): what each agent may do
# through this server, below what SilverBullet grants. Deny by default.
#
#   user-or-group   space   path          rights
#
# user-or-group: a user of the credentials file, or @group.
# space: the space prefix (notes for /notes), or * for every space.
# path: / for the whole space, an exact page name, or a folder ending in /.
#       A page name may contain single spaces.
# rights: letters of r (read, list, search), w (create, edit), d (delete),
#         x (render, screenshot), or - for nothing.
#
# The most specific path wins; on the same path a user entry wins over group
# entries; between groups - wins, otherwise rights add up.

@agents     notes   /               r
@agents     notes   CONFIG          -
@agents     notes   SETTINGS        -
@agents     notes   Library/        -
@agents     notes   Shared/         rw
writer-bot  notes   Shared/Bot/     rwdx
writer-bot  notes   Shared/         rwx
